From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.it>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:47:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 087/113] LOCAL: arm64: configs: nairo: Enable the SM7250
 interconnect driver

These changes were written with the help of an LLM and checked by a human.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RmfiVDW3KWZdb9c3iDGRYg
---
 arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config b/arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config
index 08d6b48c6..7a48686eb 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/nairo.config
@@ -76,3 +76,5 @@ CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-nairo"
 # aligned; bindgen drops that alignment and every task_struct field after
 # "stats" is 40 bytes off in the Rust bindings (rust_binder mmap -EINVAL)
 CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS=y
+# SM7250 interconnect (bandwidth votes for GPU, display, UFS, ...)
+CONFIG_INTERCONNECT_QCOM_SM7250=y
